  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Transfer a call\"\nslug: \"/apps/ios-transfer-a-call--fi98bkz81m665tyvhwu8p13p\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"iOS\",\"General\",\"ios\",\"working-with-calls\"]\n---\n\n*Looking for an&#x20;*[Android](/docs/apps/android-transfer-call--ukk2ikysb3a6guqd8gzugh87) *or&#x20;*[PC/Mac](/docs/apps/desktop-call-transfer--goxhybvy8g83rnreyy2bsadr) *version of this article?*\n\nTo transfer a call:\n\n1. During an ongoing call, press the ‘**Transfer**’ icon![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/b427aeba262a7f68c9e5/d0e3ed4c40a8dd53aaf31cd446c20e5b6876e621b0629f5a2b498569901d8577.png)\n2. Enter a phone number or choose a contact from the list, where you want to transfer a call.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/edb8bfc351b898686012/0d0fca22298c3f4d424c3c6ff35f7c5841005312008f283c4d7a7ba75651b22e.png)\n\n*1. Tap on the ‘Numpad’ icon to dial a phone number.*\n\n1. Choose if you would like to do a Blind or Attended transfer.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/a65f213d6061835daaaa/7c90b54691d7e34f4651cb03930259cb8996a7655bfef3eb9f41cc038f56333e.png)\n\nIf you choose a ‘**Blind transfer**’, you will be disconnected from this call while the caller will be transferred to the number you selected.\n\nIn the case of ‘**Attended transfer**’, the caller will be put on hold, while the app will make an outgoing call to the number/contact you chose to transfer a call to.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/34be4df9ff0292e0f5b5/dee8f68a5270725e4eddd2fd99f424bacbbbd7fbfcde4ee5f38949baf1c63857.png)\n\n1. Press the highlighted ‘**Transfer**’ button (1) to confirm the call transfer.\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Making outgoing calls](/docs/apps/ios-making-outgoing-calls--pzl38a1hg4biemmmklzs264n)\n- [Switching between two lines during a call](/docs/apps/ios-switching-between-lines--gley2co2423x5no1xjnoapcj)\n"
